  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per every 1,000 points unless otherwise stated (p. 125). The builder applies them as written, which is right for armies up to 1,000 points; scale them up yourself for larger armies.",
    "Historically each Old or Middle Guard brigade had two battalions of one kind; the list relaxes this to 2-4 battalions for flexibility.",
    "Marines of the Guard can also be fielded as two Tiny units, or as an engineer upgrade (p. 78).",
    "The chapter (pp. 63-65) gives the Young Guard 6/4/3/3, Reliable, and the Guard Heavy and Marine batteries Stamina 3; the list's table (p. 124) is followed."
  ],
