  "upgradesModelled": true,
  "specialRules": [
    "A Marshal's baton in every knapsack: the Divisional Commander has it, and Brigade Commanders can buy it. Roll for aggression, decisiveness and independence (Black Powder p. 94) on 1 Low, 2-4 Normal, 5-6 High.",
    "Guard infantry: Pas de Charge (in Attack Column they're Reliable, and a commander adds +1 ordering them in Attack Column), Must Form Square, Mixed Order, and can form skirmish order in terrain they couldn't normally enter.",
    "Guard cavalry can use the Cavalry Column of Attack (see the Army Corps list)."
  ]
